# Extra options for equinox-server (run "equinox-server -h" to list them), applied by
# "sudo systemctl restart equinox-server". Examples:
#   EQUINOX_OPTS="-listen 127.0.0.1:8080"
#   EQUINOX_OPTS="-torrent-port 51420 -completed /srv/torrents/complete"
# -downloads and -completed only matter on the very first start; later the folders are set on the page.
# The service runs as the user "equinox": a folder outside /var/lib/equinox must be writable by it.
EQUINOX_OPTS=""
